  "reviewed_obligations": [
    "Ownership is enrolled local seat custody, not legal CEO identity or business authorization; no guessed/first/only-seat recovery.",
    "Default deny/no-create startup; missing/replaced/inert/unsupported storage never invokes implicit initialization or adoption.",
